              "value": "When you resist a spell, you capture some of its magic for your own use. You enter your SoM stance, using the triggering spell to determine what damage type your SoM deals. Alternatively, if you're already in SoM, you can instead amplify its effects temporarily. Until the end of your next turn, you gain a +2 status bonus to the damage from your SoM."
